  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for the Establishment and Capacity Building of ICU(Intensive Care Unit) in Medical City, Baghdad, Rep. of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICU construction. Equipment support upon demand. On-the-spot training(capacity enhancement). Dispatch of skilled personnel. Project oversight</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide adequate medical service and environment to the seriously injured through establishment of ICU in Baghdad Medical City Hospital&#xc774;&#xb77c;&#xd06c; &#xba54;&#xb514;&#xceec; &#xc2dc;&#xd2f0;(10&#xc5ec;&#xac1c;, 3&#xcc9c;&#xbcd1;&#xc0c1;)&#xc758; ICU &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xbcd1;&#xc6d0; &#xc2e0;&#xaddc; &#xc124;&#xb9bd;&#xacfc; &#xc911;&#xd658;&#xc790; &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xc758;&#xb8cc; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc81c;&#xacf5;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xc758;&#xb8cc;/&#xd589;&#xc815;&#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc591;&#xc131;</narrative>
